1
00:00:00,503 --> 00:00:02,133
(Howard:)I know.

2
00:00:03,465 --> 00:00:06,885
I wanna thank you
for taking time to see me.

3
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:09,391
(Hawking:)My pleasure.

4
00:00:09,554 --> 00:00:12,514
(Hawking:)I enjoyed reading your paper
very much.

5
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:15,222
(Hawking:)You clearly have a brilliant mind.

6
00:00:15,727 --> 00:00:17,357
(Howard:)I know.

7
00:00:19,522 --> 00:00:22,982
(Hawking:)Your thesis that the Higgs boson
is a black hole...

8
00:00:23,151 --> 00:00:26,691
(Hawking:)...accelerating backwards
through time is fascinating.

9
00:00:27,572 --> 00:00:32,572
(Sheldon:)Thank you. It just... It came to me
one morning in the shower.

10
00:00:35,455 --> 00:00:36,745
(Howard:)That's nice.

11
00:00:36,915 --> 00:00:39,335
(Hawking:)Too bad it's wrong.

12
00:00:42,295 --> 00:00:44,715
What do you mean, "wrong"?

13
00:00:46,341 --> 00:00:49,261
(Hawking:)You made an arithmetic mistake
on page two.

14
00:00:51,387 --> 00:00:54,057
(Hawking:)It was quite the boner.

15
00:00:56,684 --> 00:01:00,394
No, no. But that can't be right.

16
00:01:00,563 --> 00:01:03,233
l don't make arithmetic mistakes.

17
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,189
(Hawking:)Are you saying I do?

18
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,780
(Sheldon:)Oh, no. No, no, of course not.

19
00:01:07,946 --> 00:01:11,536
(Sheldon:)It's just, I was thinking...
Oh, gosh, golly. I made a boo-boo.

20
00:01:12,117 --> 00:01:15,077
(Sheldon:)And I gave it to Stephen Hawking.

21
00:01:20,708 --> 00:01:23,838
(Hawking:)Great. Another fainter.

